    "question": "Carter is twice as tall as his 24” tall dog.  Betty is 12” shorter than Carter.  How tall is Betty in feet?",
    "gold": "3",
    "answer": "Carter is twice as tall as 24” dog so he is 2*24 = <<2*24=48>>48”\nBetty is 12” shorter than Carter so Betty is 48-12 = <<48-12=36>>36” tall\n12\" is the same as 1 foot so Betty is 36/12 = 3 feet tall\n#### 3"
